! Opprett ny tiddler

Velg hva du vil opprette. Skjemaet setter tagger og felter selv, slik at resultatet følger strukturen i wikien — du fyller bare ut det som ikke kan utledes.

<$let nhn-year-now=<<now "YYYY">> def={{$:/state/nhn/ny/form}}>
<div class="nhn-form-picker">
<label>Type:&#32;<$select tiddler="$:/state/nhn/ny/form">
<option value=""></option>
<$list filter="[all[shadows+tiddlers]tag[$:/tags/nhn/Form]sort[caption]]" variable="f"><option value=<<f>>><$text text={{{ [<f>get[caption]] }}}/></option></$list>
</$select></label>
</div>
<% if [<def>!is[blank]] %>
<p class="nhn-form-description"><$text text={{{ [<def>get[text]jsonget[description]] }}}/></p>
<$transclude $variable="forms-form" def=<<def>> state={{{ [<def>split[/]last[]addprefix[$:/state/nhn/form/]] }}}/>
<% endif %>
</$let>
